`,"txt.organization.merge_modal.step.confirm.list.consequences_with_count":`{{#listItem}}{{#bold}}{{loserName}}{{/bold}} will be deleted after the merge.{{/listItem}}
{{#listItem}}{{#bold}}Domains ({{domainsCount}}), users ({{usersCount}}),{{/bold}} and {{#bold}}unclosed tickets ({{ticketsCount}}){{/bold}} will be carried over to the new organization.{{/listItem}}
