{{#listItem}}{{#bold}}Domains ({{domainsCount}}), users ({{usersCount}}),{{/bold}} and {{#bold}}tickets ({{ticketsCount}}){{/bold}} will be carried over to the new organization.{{/listItem}}
{{#listItem}}Other organization fields and their values will not be carried over.{{/listItem}}
{{#listItem}}You'll need to update parts of your workflow that use {{#bold}}{{loserName}}{{/bold}} as a condition. This may include triggers, SLAs, and more.{{/listItem}}
`,"txt.organization.merge_modal.step.confirm.list.consequences_with_count4":`{{#listItem}}{{#bold}}{{loserName}}{{/bold}} will be deleted after the merge.{{/listItem}}
