{{#listItem}}{{#bold}}Domains ({{domainsCount}}), users ({{usersCount}}),{{/bold}} and {{#bold}}tickets ({{ticketsCount}}){{/bold}} will be carried over to the new organization, with last updated times set to the time the merge takes place.{{/listItem}}
